{"id": 82, "name": "Terizla", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_7fe813b1c6b84e6fb234d0428c0c7cd7.png", "cls": ["Fighter", "Tank"], "specialty": ["Burst", "Crowd Control"], "difficulty": "20", "stats": ["90", "30", "40", "20"], "lanes": ["Exp Lane", ""], "story": "Once an eccentric master smith, but now an avenger siding with the Abyss.", "skills": [{"name": "Body of Smith", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_b08818fe1736239ae3be7cf2d2dabf08.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Terizla gains 1% extra Damage Reduction (up to 20 (+1*Hero Level)%) for every 2.5% HP lost.\nHe cannot gain extra Attack Speed and will convert every 1% extra Attack Speed he's supposed to receive into 1 extra Physical Attack."}, {"name": "Revenge Strike", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_75648daf275c81c11c68d0dc99ded14a.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 61, "tagname": "Speed Up", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 8.5", "desc": "Terizla cracks the ground with his hammer and the fissure will spread out, dealing 300<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+80% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>. After the fissure hits the first target, it will drill into the target and slow them by 15%. At the same time, Terizla's Movement Speed will be increased by 15% for 3.5s. The fissure on target will then explode, dealing 300<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+80% Extra Physical Attack)</span> plus 20% of the enemy's lost HP <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>."}, {"name": "Execution Strike", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_0edb37acc50cca6239a839bdb96fea5c.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 9", "desc": "Terizla swings his hammer in a fan-shaped area ahead. This skill can be cast up to 3 times. The first two attacks deal 90<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+135% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> each, while the third deals 225<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+220% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>. Enemies hit will also be slowed by 20% for 1.25s (the Slowing Effect can stack).\nDeals only 80% damage to Minions."}, {"name": "Penalty Zone", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_da9efd3bc3382173ceef6d14503894a2.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 50", "desc": "Terizla jumps to the designated area, dealing 300<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and knocking enemies airborne for 0.6s. He then summons Scaffold and slows enemies by 25%. Scaffold will send out a hook at enemy heroes in range and pull them several times while dealing 150<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+30% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> each time."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Tough Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_e7045efd7cf5bcb488594a7eac3ab4e2.png"}, {"name": "War Axe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_60_2/100_fa1f5745cf88227722a9ff22c95c0bc4.png"}, {"name": "Dominance Ice", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1b1672399a7836284effcc60aaddd7de.png"}, {"name": "Queen's Wings", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f6bab0819a3203e65eb28da7ef1c4478.png"}, {"name": "Athena's Shield", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/im